#session-warning.hidden(role='dialog' aria-live='assertive' aria-modal='true' aria-labelledby='session-warning-title')
  .session-warning-box
    i.session-icon.fa.fa-clock-o(aria-hidden='true')
    h3#session-warning-title Session about to expire
    p
      | Your session will end in 
      strong#session-countdown 05:00
      | . Save your work or extend it now.
    button#session-extend(type='button') Extend session
